{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1362725-current-development-stages","id":1362725,"title":"Current Development Stages","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-22T14:06:03-08:00","id":1362725,"title":"Current Development Stages","content":"I was writing some of this to a friend, thought I might as well put it here as well in case people have missed it.<br /> <br /> Currently:<br /> <br /> <u>First Draft</u><br /> Exalted: Essence<br /> Hundred Devils Night Parade<br /> Adversaries of the Righteous<br /> <br /> <u>Redlines</u><br /> Many-Faced Strangers<br /> <br /> <u>Second Draft</u><br /> Crucible of Legend<br /> Exigents<br /> <br /> <u>Development</u><br /> Heirs to the Shogunate<br /> Across the Eight Directions<br /> <br /> <u>Editing</u><br /> Lunars<br /> <br /> So this year we should definitely get Lunars and the Exigents Kickstarter. And I think there's a strong chance of getting Heirs to the Shogunate and Across the Eight Directions. That's 3 books and a kickstarter, which is maybe a bit optimistic. I'm hopeful though. I can't remember how long Heirs is, longer than Miracles I'm sure (as it got a bunch of stretch goal increases*), but I think maybe still smaller than Arms or the Realm.<br /> <br /> I expected Exigents to get its kickstarter in about March, as both Lunars and Dragonblood did, but by January they'd both had 3 previews, and so far we've seen no previews whatsoever for Exigents. Thus, I'm wondering if it's been a bit slower than Lunars and Dragonblood.<br /> <br /> <br /> Hundred Devils Night Parade and Adversaries of the Righteous are a bit complicated: I think most of HDNP is written and formatted and has art, but there's some that's not at all. And Adversaries has much less published than Hundred Devils, but I'm guessing is intended to be the same length.<br /> So anyway, I guess they are in First Draft, but might go faster through the stages.<br /> <br /> <br /> *Anyone got the list of what's in Heirs?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 01-24-2020, 02:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T14:08:56-08:00","id":1362727,"title":"","content":"What\u2019s in heirs thread<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1331607-so-heirs-to-the-shogunate-huh\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1331607-so-heirs-to-the-shogunate-huh\"> So... Heirs to the Shogunate huh? - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1331607-so-heirs-to-the-shogunate-huh\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1331607-so-heirs-to-the-shogunate-huh </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Hey, can anyone remind me what was so cool about this supplement? It's been so long that I only remember being interested in a longer description for the Violet Fang... Were new Martial Arts going to be included? Man... what was the last Ex3 book released? What are you expecting from this book? </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T14:21:34-08:00","id":1362730,"title":"","content":"I'm going to put that here to make a bit more sense:<ul><li>New Charms, including 30 chosen by backers.</li> <li>5 artefacts chosen by backers.</li> <li>Additional setting detail and mechanics for Lookshy, including stats and Evocations for their fabled gunzosha armor, information on their military forces and redoubts, and a section on the gentes and individual Lookshyans of note</li> <li>Additional setting detail and mechanics for the Forest Witches, including mechanics for the dead of Atsiluth Eternal, stats for numina of the mists, and factions such as the Company of Thrones and the Table of Fiends, and individual Forest Witches of note</li> <li>Additional setting detail and mechanics for lots of outcaste groups, and some individual outcastes of note</li> <li>Additional setting detail and mechanics for the Scarlet Dynasty\u2019s cadet houses, including noteworthy cadet house members</li> <li>Additional setting detail and mechanics for the Empire of Prasad, including the Dragon Clans and noteworthy Prasadi characters</li> <li>War in the West \u2013 A section dealing with the impending war between House Peleps and House V\u2019neef, including noteworthy factions and characters involved in the War in the West</li> <li>Secondary Schools - materials to run games set in the Dynasty's secondary schools</li> <li>Realm Civil War - a section discussing the run-up to open war between the Great Houses of the Realm</li> <li>Quick Character write-ups for Tepet Arada, Ragara, Karal Linwei, Peleps Deled, V\u2019neef, Sesus Eshuvar, Kingfisher Swift, Left Hand Chalima, Righteous River, Yushoto Mathar, and five characters chosen by backers.</li> <li>2-page player handouts for the five Dragon-Blooded background options (The Realm, Lookshy, Prasad, the Forest Witches, and Outcastes)</li> </ul><br /> Also it's in colour and has chapter fiction.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-24T09:07:32-08:00","id":1363095,"title":"","content":"I am curious as to why you left out <b>Hundred Devil's Night Parade</b> and <b>Adversaries of the Righteous</b>, both of which are in the current <u>First Draft</u> section (though <b>Exalted Essence</b> isn't in the current (01/20/20) MMN development update, unless it is the <b>Exalted Essay Collection</b>) as well as <b>Many-Faced Strangers</b> (companion book to <b>Lunars: FatG</b>) in the Red Line section (since you included <b>Heirs to the Shogunate</b>, the companion book to <b>Dragon-Blooded: WFHW</b>).<br /> <br /> True, we may not see these three books in 2020, and they aren't likely to have Kickstarters (since one is a stretch goal from the Lunar Kickstarter and the other two are mostly compilations of material available from DriveThruRPG with additional unavalible material), but I am curious if there was any reason you left them off your list of what was currently in development for Exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-24T10:18:40-08:00","id":1363112,"title":"","content":"Where are you looking? The last MNM I looked at didn't have any of those three on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-24T11:04:11-08:00","id":1363137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/13713-2/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/13713-2/\" target=\"_blank\"> Kickstarters &amp; Stores &amp; Whaaat? [Monday Meeting Notes] &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/13713-2/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/13713-2/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That is the most current Monday Meeting Notes, Wizard. Those of us on the Discord server do know that Ex:Ess was supposed to be on the First Draft list because I specifically asked about that and received a positive response.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;At the risk of sounding like a murder hobo&quot;<br /> <br /> Attributed to Nyrufa.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24134-inertial-frame","name":"Inertial Frame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-24T11:48:46-08:00","id":1363156,"title":"","content":"Ah, I missed that update, thanks. I'll edit them in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-24T14:31:45-08:00","id":1363196,"title":"","content":"Sorry I didn't add the link to the last MMN for the projects I mentioned... I honestly thought you had used it for the information you had already posted. Still haven't seen anything about Exalted: Essence in the notes... but then that isn't surprising given that it is still a fairly new project (I think).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-24T15:14:20-08:00","id":1363204,"title":"","content":"Yeah, it's not in the notes, I just saw a few days ago on the Discord that the writers said it had just moved from the Alpha stage to its proper First Draft. But they've only just started the First Draft. Whereas Hundred Devils Night Parade I think is completely written in first draft form, and like 50%+ I think has already been edited (and has art). So while they're both in &quot;First Draft&quot; I think we can expect HDNP a long time before Exalted: Essence. I wouldn't even be shocked if we saw it before Crucible of Legend and Exigents. But who knows. (Adversaries I expect later than HDNP, but again, that's just my prediction.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-27T10:25:22-08:00","id":1363652,"title":"","content":"Just to add, while Heirs and Eight Directions are both &quot;in development&quot;, Eight Directions just got into Development, and is waiting for Heirs. So it'll be Lunars, then Heirs, then Across the Eight Directions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}